# --- Claude Code -------------------------------------------------------------
# .claude/ is NOT tracked — the working set (CLAUDE.md, skills, agents, hooks,
# settings.json) is handed to new developers by copy, not by clone.
# See document/getting-started/onboarding.md §4 for what to copy and what must
# never leave the machine (FromAI/, settings.local.json).
# NOTE: .gitignore has no inline comments — never append "# ..." after a pattern.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json

**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# workflow_settings.yaml is intentionally NOT listed here: it is already tracked,
# so the old ignore entry never took effect. Edits to it are committed and shared.

# --- SPK plugin ---------------------------------------------------------------
# ai_context/ is scaffolding created by the spk@inline Claude Code plugin.
# It duplicates document/project_wiki/, which is the authoritative LLM wiki here
# (and the only one the doc-sync hard rule and the Stop hook enforce).
# Decision 2026-08-26: do not track it. Deleting the folder is safe -- the plugin
# recreates it on the next session start.
ai_context/
